  "summary": "Make the Output detector bright when exactly one of beams A and B is on, and dark when both are on. A comes from the left and B from below, with a fixed phase between them. You may place one slab of dense glass in the marked region. The score is the contrast between the dimmest bright case and the brightest dark case, in decibels.",
